<title>USA: US May factory orders fell 0.7 pct.</title>
<headline>US May factory orders fell 0.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commerce seasonally adjusted data on U.S. factory orders, shipments and unfilled orders.</p>
<p>    ORDERS-PCT CHANGES:  May--(Prev)	Apr--(Prev)     Mar</p>
<p> New Orders		 -0.7		  1.4    1.2     -1.7</p>
<p> -Ex-Transportation     -0.4		  1.2    0.9     -1.2</p>
<p> -Ex-Defense		-0.4		  1.0    0.8     -1.4</p>
<p> NonDurables		-0.7		  0.8    1.1     -0.3</p>
<p> Durables		   -0.7   -0.6	 1.8    1.8     -2.8</p>
<p> NonDefense Cap	    0.4    0.7	-1.7   -1.7     -3.8</p>
<p> -Ex-Aircraft, Parts     0.3    0.6	-1.5   -1.5     -1.7</p>
<p> -Defense Cap	    -13.0  -12.8	27.5   27.5    -14.7</p>
<p>    ORDERS-PCT CHANGES:  May--(Prev)	Apr--(Prev)     Mar</p>
