<p> Unfilled-Durables	 UNCH  UNCH	-0.3   -0.3     -0.5</p>
<p> SHIPMENTS-PCT CHANGES:  May--(Prev)	Apr--(Prev)     Mar</p>
<p>  Total		     -1.0		  1.2    1.2	UNCH</p>
<p>  Durables		  -1.4   -1.2	 1.3    1.3	0.8</p>
<p> ORDERS-BLNS OF DLRS:   May---(Prev)     Apr---(Prev)     Mar</p>
<p>  New Orders	    323.32	     325.54  324.92   321.15</p>
